      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I always kinda liked how mirrors looked slightly different than the world (they were not 100% super duper perfect). But that huge color shift in your example is obviously not a thing were I think it's a nice \"slightly off, but not too much\" situation.\n\nMaybe exposing this as an option the user could pick in the SDK would be nice?",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
